flowchart TB
 I[结构化运行事实<br/>task／operation／epoch／request／call 身份]:::truth
 C[归类 canonical 事件<br/>无法解释的事实保留 unknown 与来源]:::derived
 P[同 scope 精确配对调用与结果]:::derived
 N[共同 narrative／digest／compact 产物]:::derived
 S[已提交 stable 事实与当前 live 活动<br/>各自有水位和来源]:::derived
 U[typed 视角投影]:::derived
 A[公开语义查询与更新]:::derived
 M[共享呈现：当前／语义／动作]:::derived
 I --> C --> P --> N --> S --> U
 U -.->|当前生产全链消费仍未闭合| A
 A --> M
 Q[用户主动证据请求或显式 raw 模式]:::truth
 R[只读查询原始记录与不可变资产]:::derived
 D[raw 模式／证据 drawer
来源引用与双向导航]:::derived
 Q --> R --> D

classDef truth fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#1d4ed8,color:#1e3a8a,stroke-width:2px;
classDef derived fill:#e0f2fe,stroke:#0284c7,color:#0c4a6e;
classDef design fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706,color:#78350f,stroke-dasharray:5 3;
classDef gap fill:#fee2e2,stroke:#dc2626,color:#7f1d1d,stroke-width:2px;
classDef evidence fill:#f1f5f9,stroke:#64748b,color:#334155;

